      "mergedPostDetails": "Soo its been 2 weeks that i have been away and havent played VRChat, After trying the live build that gave me 0 problems i decided to try and install the Open Beta. \nAfter Opening and logging in VRChat the screen remains at the image linked\nProcedures tried:\n- Clean reinstall\n- Deleted Temp Files\n- Rebooted computer\n- Deleted Custom Config file\nI am sure this is NOT and Easy anti cheat problem because VRChat loads fine on Stable/Live.\nThing i noticed is that the FPS significantly lower after staying on this screen for Aprox. 15 Seconds\n\nLog: https://gist.github.com/LabeVR/b537674c7f1d18fcf3ed9373dddc81c7",
