  "created": "2022-07-30T09:11:10.273Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I had a home world set to a world id that was deleted, on live it loads me back to the default VRChat Home world just fine, but in the open beta I end up in a endless loop. \nAnd the only way to actually load it properly is to join a world via a link.\n# Expected Behavior\nLoad into default VRChat Home world instead.\n# Current Behavior\nEnds up in a endless hitchy loading loop\n# Steps to Reproduce\n1. Set your home world to a world id that doesn't exists or that you can delete.\n2. Delete the world (if needed)\n3. Load into VRChat\n4. Once logged in, all UI will disappear.\n5. View will start hitching badly, and logs will show 404 repeatedly \n\n\nhttps://gist.github.com/PhaxeNor/11d71f8bc90c9a367277e79d1ad2b3b7",
